Let’s add now \(N\) producer bacteria as point sources
\[
Q(x,y)=\sum_{k}^N \delta(x-x_k,y-y_k)
\]
And compute the value for the numerator
\[
G(x,y)=\int_0^{L_x} \int_0^{L_y} \sum_{k}^N \delta(x_i-x_k,y_i-y_k) e^{-\sqrt{(x-x_i)²+(y-y_i)²}/\lambda}
dy_i dx_i
\]
\[
G(x,y)=\sum_{k}^N \int_0^{L_x} \int_0^{L_y} \delta(x_i-x_k,y_i-y_k) e^{-\sqrt{(x-x_i)²+(y-y_i)²}/\lambda} dy_i dx_i
\] and using the sifting property of the delta function we get \[
G(x,y)=\sum_{k}^N e^{-\sqrt{(x-x_k)²+(y-y_k)²}/\lambda}
\]
